Matrix a1, a2, b1, b2, c1, c2, result
Note lane1, lane2, times1, times2, plus, formula
Note adim1, adim2, bdim1, bdim2, cdim1, cdim2, rdim
Label a1 $A_1$
Label a2 $A_2$
Label b1 $B_1$
Label b2 $B_2$
Label c1 $C_1$
Label c2 $C_2$
Label result $C$
Label lane1 "DEVICE 1"
Label lane2 "DEVICE 2"
Label times1 $\times$
Label times2 $\times$
Label plus $+$
Label formula $AB=A_1B_1+A_2B_2$
Label adim1 $n\times k$
Label adim2 $n\times k$
Label bdim1 $k\times p$
Label bdim2 $k\times p$
Label cdim1 $n\times p$
Label cdim2 $n\times p$
Label rdim $n\times p$
Flow(b1, c1)
Flow(b2, c2)
